<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-KNP BT Q2 net rises 106 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-KNP BT Q2 net rises 106 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second qtr to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)		 0.74 vs   0.41</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	85    vs  51</p>
<p>    Total net after extraordinaries  105    vs  51</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		    3.81 vs   3.30</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected paper and office equipment group NV Koninklijke KNP BT to post a 1997 second-qtr net from ordinary operations of between 61 and 90 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		     165    vs 117</p>
<p>    Interest charges			41    vs  32</p>
<p>    Tax					 41    vs  21</p>
<p>    Associates' income		gain 9    vs  12 charge</p>
<p>    Minorities charge			7    vs   1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains		   20    vs nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
